{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18386","headline":"贡院楼北新栽小松 · 李正封","name":"贡院楼北新栽小松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青苍初得地，华省植来新。\n尚带山中色，犹含洞里春。\n近楼依北户，隐砌净游尘。\n鹤寿应成盖，龙形未有鳞。\n爲梁资大厦，封爵耻嬴秦。\n幸此观光日，清风屡得亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李正封","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}